    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/da015ec55debe4f318a8c5c698fb2e08.avif?t=1740002413\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a remote, snowbound wilderness, you're thrust into the unforgiving reality of survival. The last member of a doomed expedition, your objective is as haunting as the icy landscape around you: find and photograph the 13 fallen explorers who came before you, their bodies now scattered and frozen in time. But survival here is a delicate balance between life and death, demanding constant vigilance, resourcefulness, and grit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/65ceb644778046250f10d0019d003dbe.poster.avif?t=1740002413\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/65ceb644778046250f10d0019d003dbe.webm?t=1740002413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/65ceb644778046250f10d0019d003dbe.mp4?t=1740002413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By day, the bleak, white expanse offers a deceptive calm. You must scour the desolate terrain for anything that can aid in your survival. Abandoned vehicles, derelict tents, and crumbling buildings may hold the key to enduring another day. Gather materials to craft vital tools, weapons, and shelter. Monitor your hunger, warmth, and health as you explore, ensuring you are always prepared for the night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/7361edd5b4c6c002441e9005121ca831.avif?t=1740002413\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As darkness falls, the true peril reveals itself. Night is when the cold bites hardest, and the creatures of the night emerge, drawn by your presence. Combat becomes inevitable as you fend off these threats, using whatever means you have crafted or scavenged during the day. The day-night cycle is your constant companion and adversary, dictating your actions and strategies. Daylight is your ally for exploration and gathering, but as night descends, survival becomes your only focus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/2a31add9a89bcc2d32e3b20a6d7ae2f4.poster.avif?t=1740002413\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/2a31add9a89bcc2d32e3b20a6d7ae2f4.webm?t=1740002413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/2a31add9a89bcc2d32e3b20a6d7ae2f4.mp4?t=1740002413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a quest for discovery, but a fight for survival against nature\u2019s most brutal elements. Each day is a test of endurance, each night a battle for your life. Will you manage to uncover the mysteries buried in the snow, or will the relentless cold and lurking dangers claim you as their next victim? Your predecessors failed, but the story isn't over yet. The frozen wilderness holds its secrets close\u2014are you ready to uncover them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/446483a9c3d455d7fc878e3cd049bd64.avif?t=1740002413\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
