ssets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/7361edd5b4c6c002441e9005121ca831.avif?t=1740002413\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > As darkness falls, the true peril reveals itself. Night is when the cold bites hardest, and the creatures of the night emerge, drawn by your presence. Combat becomes inevitable as you fend off these threats, using whatever means you have crafted or scavenged during the day. The day-night cycle is your constant companion and adversary, dictating your actions and strategies. Daylight is your ally for exploration and gathering, but as night descends, survival becomes your only focus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/2a31add9a89bcc2d32e3b20a6d7ae2f4.poster.avif?t=1740002413\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/2a31add9a89bcc2d32e3b20a6d7ae2f4.webm?t=1740002413\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/2a31add9a89bcc2d32e3b20a6d7ae2f4.mp4?t=1740002413\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just a quest for discovery, but a fight for survival against nature\u2019s most brutal elements. Each day is a test of endurance, each night a battle for your life. Will you manage to uncover the mysteries buried in the snow, or will the relentless cold and lurking dangers claim you as their next victim? Your predecessors failed, but the story isn't over yet. The frozen wilderness holds its secrets close\u2014are you ready to uncover them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2797540/extras/446483a9c3d455d7fc878e3cd049bd64.avif?t=1740002413\" data-has-big width=800 height=250 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "In Cold Warms Us, survive a frozen wilderness as you search for 13 fallen expedition members. By day, scavenge and craft to stay alive; by night, fight off deadly threats. Balance hunger, cold, and health as you uncover the secrets buried in the snow. Will you endure the unforgiving cold?",
